    "$comment": "Modules the rules above already name but that don't exist yet, so that work adding them in parallel needs no edit here. A planned module counts as present: it gives its directory a module and its component its stylesheet of the same name, and its component's classes may go unused until it exists. Once every planned module exists, empty this list.",
