      "env-icon": "The icon wrapper, which every component colors through currentColor and sizes through --env-icon-size.",
      "env-prose": "The prose typography (Prose.css) of Markdown, RichText and RichTextEditor's document.",
      "env-skeleton-content": "A skeleton's inert content without a box, which every component that takes skeleton renders inside its busy root (Skeleton.css).",
